    "body": "fix on issue/45-setup-navigation · PR #959 · pinned by mcp_order::{rename_and_reorder_are_listed_with_their_schemas, reorder_moves_within_its_setup_one_undo_step_and_refuses_another_setup, rename_keeps_the_key_and_the_order_and_round_trips} · merges at the next cut\n\nThe GUI parts of this issue had already shipped: rename, saved order and within-setup drag and drop (PR #58), the Setups ribbon cell and browser row (#322), and the per-setup operation grouping (#343). This PR adds the missing MCP tools for RenameOperation and ReorderOperation, so the issue closes when it merges.",
